<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; 5 Red Flags to Watch Out For When Hiring a Car Transport Service
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the most common red flags that indicate a car transport service might be fraudulent?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Common red flags include unusually low quotes, refusal to provide a written pre‑transit inspection slip, lack of a verifiable physical office, verbal insurance promises without official documentation, and the use of ordinary trucks instead of hydraulic car carrier trailers. Spotting any of these signs should prompt further verification before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I verify that a car transport company’s insurance is legitimate?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Ask for a copy of the IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy, check the policy number on the insurer’s website, and confirm coverage limits match the declared value of your vehicle. Legitimate movers will also provide a certificate of insurance and explain claim procedures in writing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is a written pre‑transit inspection slip crucial for my vehicle’s safety?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A written inspection slip documents the vehicle’s condition before loading, serving as legal proof of any pre‑existing damages. It protects you from false claims of damage during transit and ensures the carrier acknowledges responsibility for any new issues that arise.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I look for when evaluating the physical address of a car mover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Verify the address via Google Maps, check for a visible office or warehouse, and call the listed number to speak with staff on‑site. Absence of a real location or a mismatch between the address and online reviews often signals a fraudulent operation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is it safe to book a car transport service that operates only on Indian Railways?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Rail‑based car transport can be reliable if the provider is authorized by Indian Railways, offers a written consignment note, and provides insurance coverage. However, ensure they also have a verified office, transparent pricing, and a clear loading/unloading process to avoid hidden risks.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure the use of hydraulic car carrier trailers for my vehicle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad owns a fleet of specialized hydraulic car carrier trailers equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Their standard operating procedure includes pre‑loading checks, live GPS tracking, and a documented handover process, guaranteeing safe and secure transport.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What additional costs should I anticipate beyond the quoted price for a Delhi‑to‑Mumbai car move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Beyond the base quote, consider fuel surcharges, tolls on NH‑19, insurance premiums, and any optional services like door‑to‑door delivery or expedited handling. A reputable mover will provide a transparent cost breakdown up front, preventing surprise fees.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
